Project Overview
This Power BI dashboard provides a comprehensive analysis of Blinkit's sales performance, profitability, delivery efficiency, and customer payment behavior.
The dashboard helps identify top-performing products, profitable categories, and city-wise business performance through interactive visualizations.

Dataset Information
The dataset contains the following fields:
Order_ID
Order_Date
City
Category
Product_Name
Quantity
Unit_Price
Delivery_Time_Min
Payment_Mode
Sales
Cost
Profit
Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
Total Sales
Total Profit
Total Orders
Total Quantity Sold
Average Delivery Time
Profit Margin %

Dashboard Visualizations
Sales Trend Analysis
Tracks sales performance over time and identifies sales fluctuations.

Category Performance
Analyzes revenue contribution across different product categories.

Product Performance
Highlights top-selling products based on total sales.

Payment Mode Distribution
Shows customer preference among UPI, Card, and Cash payments.

City-wise Sales & Profit Analysis
Interactive map visualization displaying regional business performance.

Key Business Insights
Banana, Milk, and Chips are among the highest-selling products.
Dairy and Fruits & Vegetables contribute strong profitability.
Digital payments such as UPI and Card dominate customer transactions.
Delivery performance varies across cities and presents optimization opportunities.

